      "hero_html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:72px 40px 80px;gap:0;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n    <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:32px;height:2px;background:#A0732A;\"></span>\n    <small style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:#A0732A;text-transform:uppercase;\">Core Campus · SOP Automation</small>\n  </div>\n  <h1 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(36px,5.5vw,64px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.12;color:#1C1917;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:720px;\">\n    팀원이 생겼는데,<br>\n    <em style=\"font-style:normal;color:#A0732A;\">설명은 왜 매번<br>당신 몫인가요?</em>\n  </h1>\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(16px,1.8vw,20px);line-height:1.75;color:#4A3F35;max-width:560px;margin:0 0 40px;\">\n    Claude가 당신의 말투·절차·기준을 그대로 읽고,\n    <strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1C1917;\">팀 온보딩 SOP 문서 전체를 자동으로 완성</strong>합니다.\n    반복 설명 없이, 오해 없이, 처음부터 제대로.\n  </p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:56px;\">\n    <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#3D2B1F;color:#FBF8F3;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">코스 시작하기</a>\n    <a href=\"#preview\" style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;color:#A0732A;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #A0732A;padding-bottom:2px;\">커리큘럼 미리보기 →</a>\n  </div>\n  <hr style=\"width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #EDE5D8;margin:0 0 40px;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n      <strong style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1917;\">6시간</strong>\n      <figcaption style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6A5A;\">SOP 초안 완성까지</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <div style=\"width:1px;background:#EDE5D8;\"></div>\n    <figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n      <strong style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1917;\">Zero</strong>\n      <figcaption style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6A5A;\">반복 구두 설명 횟수</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <div style=\"width:1px;background:#EDE5D8;\"></div>\n    <figure style=\"margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n      <strong style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1917;\">100%</strong>\n      <figcaption style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6A5A;\">내 말투로 작성된 문서</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</div>",
